source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: Jira treats U+200B as a Monospace Span boundary; jiro drops the two boundary runes and keeps the inline code.
